	(text_box "DESIGN NOTES - POWER RAILS\n\nFrom VSYS:\n- 5V buck TPS62933 3A: -> 5V_SDR via TPS2596 eFuse 1.5A (sheet USB Host), -> 5V_LCD load switch.\n- 3V3 buck TPS62933 3A: branches each with shunt (+ switch where noted):\n  3V3_P4, 3V3_C5, 3V3_ETH (sw), 3V3_GPS (sw), 3V3_M1421 (sw), 3V3_PERIPH.\n- P4 core supplies (VDD_HP buck etc.): COPY FROM REFERENCE BOARD (MP1605/MP1658/RT9193 circuit).\nSwitch enables from TCA6408A expander. Test point on EVERY rail + 0R link per branch for staged bring-up."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
